  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-07T12:49:08.283Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a minor problem with the camera on desktop mode.\nSometimes if people are close to you in game while your trying to make a photo, the blue character select around the avatar seems to prevent you from taking photos. It takes priority over you clicking the \"Take Photo\" button, even though UI wise that should be on top. \nIt's annoying, often im talking to friends which are close and still flying the camera around, and then i just hope they move away, or i have to exit the camera, face a wall, and then go back into camera mode to take photos again.\nProblem would also be solved if you can use a hotkey while using the camera. There is F12 but that just takes a picture using your normal non-camera view.\nThis problem exists in current beta version on 7-okt-2022.\nOh and as a bonus, black and white filter on the camera would be nice, prolly not that hard to do either?",
